3. Figure containing Charades-Ego video frames: NOT CC BY 4.0
======================================================================

The following figure reproduces still frames of the Charades-Ego dataset
(Sigurdsson et al., 2018; (C) The Allen Institute for Artificial
Intelligence) as an example of the model's video reconstruction:

  figs/vis/vis_video_model_ego_noise0.3.pdf

It is excluded from the CC BY 4.0 license in Section 2. The video frames it
contains remain subject to the Charades-Ego "License for Non-Commercial Use",
reproduced in full below. In particular, they may not be used commercially,
and they may not be extracted, modified, or redistributed.

